 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 674156,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Consider service variability instances where you were a customer and noticed exceptional service and poor service. For each instance, answer the following questions:\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: lower-alpha;margin-left:1em;padding-left:1em;\">\n<li>Were you surprised?</li>\n<li>What specifically made you notice?</li>\n<li>Had you had this experience before with this company or another company?</li>\n<li>What response did you have? For instance, did you compliment? Tip? Complain? Do nothing? And why?</li>\n<li>If you were the company owner, what kind of training program would you develop to address the poor service you experienced? What might you implement as a reward for exceptional service? Why?</li>\n</ol>",
